{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "PSA",
  "chapter": 73,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.73.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Surely God is good to Israel,",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "Even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to such as are pure in heart.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.73.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But as for me, my feet were almost gone;\nMy steps had well nigh slipped.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.73.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For I was envious at the arrogant,\nWhen I saw the prosperity of the wicked.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.73.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For there are no pangs in their death;\nBut their strength is firm.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.73.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They are not in trouble as ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "other",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " men;\nNeither are they plagued like ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "other",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " men.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.73.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Therefore pride is as a chain about their neck;\nViolence covereth them as a garment.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.73.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Their eyes stand out with fatness:They have more than heart could wish.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.73.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They scoff, and in wickedness utter oppression:\nThey speak loftily.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.73.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They have set their mouth in the heavens,\nAnd their tongue walketh through the earth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.73.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Therefore his people return hither:\nAnd waters of a full ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "cup",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " are drained by them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.73.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And they say, How doth God know?\nAnd is there knowledge in the Most High?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.73.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Behold, these are the wicked;\nAnd, being alway at ease, they increase in riches.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.73.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Surely in vain have I cleansed my heart,\nAnd washed my hands in innocency;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.73.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For all the day long have I been plagued,\nAnd chastened every morning.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.73.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If I had said, I will speak thus;\nBehold, I had dealt treacherously with the generation of thy children.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.73.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When I thought how I might know this,\nIt was too painful for me;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.73.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Until I went into the sanctuary of God,\nAnd considered their latter end.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.73.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Surely thou settest them in slippery places:\nThou castest them down to destruction.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.73.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "How are they become a desolation in a moment!\nThey are utterly consumed with terrors.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.73.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "As a dream when one awaketh,\nSo, O Lord, when thou awakest, thou wilt despise their image.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.73.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For my soul was grieved,\nAnd I was pricked in my heart:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.73.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "So brutish was I, and ignorant;\nI was ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "as",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a beast before thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.73.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Nevertheless I am continually with thee:\nThou hast holden my right hand.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.73.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou wilt guide me with thy counsel,\nAnd afterward receive me to glory.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.73.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Whom have I in heaven ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "but thee",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": "?\nAnd there is none upon earth that I desire besides thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.73.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My flesh and my heart faileth;",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "But",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " God is the strength of my heart and my portion for ever.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.73.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For, lo, they that are far from thee shall perish:\nThou hast destroyed all them that play the harlot, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "departing",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " from thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.73.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But it is good for me to draw near unto God:\nI have made the Lord Jehovah my refuge,\nThat I may tell of all thy works.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ],
  "headings": [
    {
      "style": "ms1",
      "text": "Book III",
      "before_verse": 1
    },
    {
      "style": "s1",
      "text": "The end of the wicked contrasted with that of the righteous.",
      "before_verse": 1
    },
    {
      "style": "d",
      "text": "A Psalm of Asaph.",
      "before_verse": 1
    }
  ]
}
